              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mösa akaraarëka umuiraniö gua Abhaisiraeri bhonsui akabhateebhia iga, “Gano ngo amang'ana gano ÖMÖNENE aruusiri ëngamba iga mökore: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
